OL,3,AGrim discoveries of murdered women
OL,4,Aspark fear in South Africa
OL,5,
OL,6,F"What we are going to do, I have no
OL,7,Fidea," sobs Nokwanda Matshikiza,
OL,8,Freflecting on the murder of her niece
OL,9,FDineo Motapane. "But something must
OL,10,Fgive."
OL,12,F"For us, for all the other women. How
OL,13,Fmany other bodies will be found before
OL,14,Fsomething happens?"
OL,16,FNokwanda is speaking to the BBC from
OL,17,Fthe family home near South Africa's
OL,18,Fmain city, Johannesburg, just two days
OL,19,Fafter relatives identified Dineo's
OL,20,Fbody.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
